mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>?</span></p><div style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.25in; unicode-bidi: embed; direction: ltr; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">2.</span><span style='color: black; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>수업시간에 </span><span style='color: black; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>챙겨야할</span><span style='color: black; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; m